  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scholarships for Haitian students</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IN 2022 BonZeb kicked off its Haitian Educational Scholarship program by awarding scholarships to 12 schools, while assisting 160 students from Kindergarten to University. BonZeb&apos;s plan is to make these donations annually, to make sure each student can complete their education without interruption due to financial issues at home. To do this BonZeb needs to raise an additional $10,000 per year. This past year half that amount was raised by the generosity of our donors. Please consider become one.</narrative>
  </description>
